@startuml

plane_state_machine
title UML State Machine Diagram for Plane

[*] --> Order

state Order
Order : entry / acquirePlane

state Arrival
Arrival : entry / planeArrives
Arrival : do / transitionToPreparation

state Preparation
Preparation : entry / preparePlane
Preparation : choice / checkConditionAndSchedule(plane)
Preparation --> Operations / scheduledFlightsExist
Preparation --> Maintenance / noScheduledFlightsOrMaintenanceRequired

state Operations
Operations : entry / assignToOperations
Operations : condition / checkScheduledFlights(plane)
Operations : when / scheduledFlightsExist
Operations : do / keepInOperations
Operations : else
Operations : do / sendToMaintenance

state Maintenance
Maintenance : entry / sendToMaintenance
Maintenance : choice / checkRequirements(plane)
Maintenance --> Preparation / readyForOperations
Maintenance --> Order / outOfService

state OutOfService
OutOfService : entry / takeOutOfService

state PermanentlyWithdrawn
PermanentlyWithdrawn : entry / permanentlyWithdrawPlane
PermanentlyWithdrawn : do / removeFromOperations
@enduml
